    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUPER MARKET is a fun, silly game about shopping with superpowers, throwing items at friends, and racing to be the first to finish your shopping while the world around is gets crazier and crazier. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your character and get your shopping online with friends in the superhero online shopping mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUPER MARKET is made by Spectacularly Obsolete Logic Operations: Glitchy Applications Marvelously Executed Shoddily. The safe place where it will be fun and break and breaking makes it more fun. We are a small independent Australian game studio making games that you can afford (Tough economy; Have fun and don't break the bank).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise Your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go shopping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw items at friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get swoll with powerups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May cause hate or love feelings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win! Or lose if you're not good enough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer. Great for lucky people who have friends. :'(\u00a0</p></li></ul>",
